>That's an idea--another one I'm partial to is this:  Give wizards with
>intelligence/wisdom of 25/25 (pretty hard to attain, so I don't think
>this would be too unbalancing) auto-identify, or at least a good
>chance for auto-identify.  An extra reason for Wizards to find a
>you-know-what, just as Valks have a reason to find you-know-whats.
